{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952390/extras/e0db72871dbc6e753c15382651a3efd4.avif?t=1774478904\" width=616 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952390/extras/119e1f1005b2c318ac244b0b1161fbf9.avif?t=1774478904\" width=1152 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hero of Sunset, explore the open world of Nordalfer as Selphie. Face dangerous enemies, unravel mysteries, learn skills, solve puzzles, and meet beloved characters you can romance! This action-adventure lets you play it your way, creating your own path. Uncover all the secrets of the overworld? Speed \u200b\u200bto the temples? Focus on your ideal partner? It's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952390/extras/c6f57b1463f9fe7876eac7df3855298a.webp?t=1774478904\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selphie starts her journey with a single objective: to find her disappeared sister, Orielle. After following her tracks to the town of Stelapar, she finds herself caught up in a terrible disaster: one of the Dawn Crystal, the seal set upon the Twilight Lord by the Hero of Sunset hundreds of years ago, shatters before her eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding herself entangled in this plot, she finds herself tasked with finding the Eclipse Keys to protect the second crystal and prevent this ancient evil from reawakening. And perhaps, to her own surprise, she might end up receiving the gift of love from destiny...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla